<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8"/>
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
<title>Happy Birthday Dear Bestie</title>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600&family=Dancing+Script:wght@700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
*
{margin:0;
    padding:0
    ;box-sizing:border-box
}
html{
    scroll-behavior:smooth
}
body{
    font-family:'Poppins',sans-serif;
    background:#ffd6e7;
    overflow-x:hidden
}
h1,h2{
    font-family:'Dancing Script',cursive
}
#hero{
    height:100vh;
    background:#0c0510;
    position:relative;
    display:flex;
    align-items:center;
    justify-content:center;
    flex-direction:column;
    text-align:center;
    color:#fff;
    overflow:hidden
}
#hero::before{
    content:'';
    position:absolute;
    width:800px;
    height:800px;
    top:50%;
    left:50%;
    transform:translate(-50%,-50%)
}
#hero h1{
    font-size:58px;
    color:#ff6fae;
    text-shadow:0 0 15px #ff2d7b,0 0 35px #ff2d7b;
    line-height:1.1;
    z-index:2
}
#hero small, #hero p, .btn-pink{
    z-index:2
}
.btn-pink{
    margin-top:20px;
    background:#ff3f86;
    color:#fff;
    border:none;
    padding:11px 26px;
    border-radius:999px;
    font-weight:600;
    cursor:pointer;
    box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(255,63,134,.6)
}
.hearts{
    position:absolute;
    inset:0;
    pointer-events:none}
.h{
    position:absolute;
    animation:up linear infinite
}
@keyframes up{
    0%{transform:translateY(110vh);
    opacity:0}10%{opacity:1}100%{transform:translateY(-10vh);opacity:0}
}
.light{
    background:#ffd6e7;
    padding:70px 8%
}
.flex{
    display:flex;
    gap:40px;
    align-items:center;
    flex-wrap:wrap;
    justify-content:center
}
.round-img{
    width:280px;
    height:280px;
    border-radius:50%;
    object-fit:cover;
    border:10px solid #fff
}
.text-box{
    max-width:580px
}
.text-box h2{
    font-size:34px;
    color:#a61e4e
}
.center-title{
    font-size:34px;
    color:#a61e4e;
    text-align:center;
    margin-bottom:30px
}
.wish-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(5,1fr);
    gap:14px
}
.wish{
    background:#fff;
    border-radius:18px;
    padding:20px 10px;
    text-align:center
}
.mem-grid{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);
    gap:14px
}
.mem img{
    width:100%;
    height:280px;
    object-fit:cover;
    border-radius:16px
}
.msg{
    background:#fff5f8;
    padding:70px 12%;
    text-align:center
}
#final{
    background:#0c0510;
    color:#fff;
    padding:80px 8%;
    text-align:center;
    position:relative;
    overflow:hidden
}
#final h2{
    font-size:36px;
    color:#ff9ac0
    }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<section id="hero">
<div class="hearts" id="h1"></div>
<small>To the most special person in my life 💖</small>
<h1>Happy Birthday<br>Dear Bestie 💖</h1>
<p>Today is all about you 💕</p>
<button class="btn-pink" onclick="document.getElementById('about').scrollIntoView()">Let's Celebrate 🎉</button>
</section>

<section class="light" id="about">
<div class="flex">
<img class="round-img" src="REPLACE_WITH_PHOTO_1">
<div class="text-box">
<h2>You Are Amazing! 💖</h2>
<p>On your special day, I want to remind you how incredible you are. Your kindness, your laughter, your beautiful soul — everything about you makes my life better.<br><br>I'm so lucky to have you in my life 💖</p>
</div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="light">
<h2 class="center-title">💖 Birthday Wishes For You 💖</h2>
<div class="wish-grid">
<div class="wish">😊<h4>Happiness</h4></div>
<div class="wish">🌟<h4>Success</h4></div>
<div class="wish">💖<h4>Love</h4></div>
<div class="wish">🍀<h4>Good Health</h4></div>
<div class="wish">🙏<h4>Blessings</h4></div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="light">
<h2 class="center-title">💕 Our Beautiful Memories 💕</h2>
<div class="mem-grid">
<div class="mem"><img src="REPLACE_PHOTO_2"></div>
<div class="mem"><img src="REPLACE_PHOTO_3"></div>
<div class="mem"><img src="REPLACE_PHOTO_4"></div>
<div class="mem"><img src="REPLACE_PHOTO_5"></div>
</div>
</section>

<section class="msg">
<h2>💌 A Special Message For You 💌</h2>
<p>Life will bring beautiful days and challenging days, but I love you and remember your strength... Always keep smiling, keep shining, and keep being YOU!</p>
</section>

<section id="final">
<div class="hearts" id="h2"></div>
<h2>🎁 A Final Surprise For You 🎁</h2>
<p>Close your eyes for a moment, make a wish, and imagine all the wonderful things the coming year will bring for you.</p>
<button class="btn-pink" id="revealBtn">Open Your Final Surprise 🎉</button>
<h3 id="finalMsg" style="display:none">Happy Birthday Once Again!<br><span style="font-family:Poppins;font-size:14px">Lots of love, Dear Bestie! ❤️</span></h3>
</section>
</body>
</html>
